      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Compute\n    - Server?\n    - Serverless?\n\nStorage\n    - Blob?\n        - Lakehouse\n    - Relational?\n    - Non-Relational?\n        - key-value\n        - wide-column\n        - document\n    - B-tree vs LSTM for read/write consideraetions\n\nSecurity\n\nNetworking\n\nContainres\n\nBig Data\n    - See pandas vs polars vs spark\n        - single core single CPU, multi core single CPU, multi core distributive CPU\n\nAi/ML\n\nObservaibility & Monitoring ",
      "fontSize": 24.28607058520107,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Compute\n    - Server?\n    - Serverless?\n\nStorage\n    - Blob?\n        - Lakehouse\n    - Relational?\n    - Non-Relational?\n        - key-value\n        - wide-column\n        - document\n    - B-tree vs LSTM for read/write consideraetions\n\nSecurity\n\nNetworking\n\nContainres\n\nBig Data\n    - See pandas vs polars vs spark\n        - single core single CPU, multi core single CPU, multi core distributive CPU\n\nAi/ML\n\nObservaibility & Monitoring ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
