      "updated": 1783988529395,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Comprehensive System Design Provider Mapping",
      "fontSize": 74.19568965517242,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 32,
      "frameId": "Ns8tkcfQ1gouZGlgHC0ly",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Comprehensive System Design Provider Mapping",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CuXU1r4Q4-5yYXZjXYTh1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -10767.157276396918,
      "y": 8064.286860570837,
      "width": 2890.412109375,
      "height": 1339.6443965517242,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
      "seed": 1097456863,
      "version": 308,
      "versionNonce": 1276948095,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783988529395,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CATEGORY             | OPEN SOURCE / AGNOSTIC | AWS                     | GCP                      | AZURE\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCOMPUTE\n - Server (VM)       | KVM, KubeVirt          | EC2                     | Compute Engine (GCE)     | Virtual Machines\n - Serverless        | OpenFaaS, Knative      | Lambda                  | Cloud Functions          | Azure Functions\n\nSTORAGE\n - Blob / Lakehouse  | MinIO + Apache Iceberg | S3 + Athena/Lake Form.  | GCS + BigLake            | ADLS + Fabric/Synapse\n - Relational        | PostgreSQL / MySQL     | RDS / Aurora            | Cloud SQL / AlloyDB      | Azure SQL\n - KV / Document     | Redis / MongoDB        | DynamoDB                | Firestore                | Cosmos DB\n - Wide-Column       | Apache Cassandra       | Keyspaces               | Bigtable                 | Cosmos DB (Cassandra API)\n\nCONTAINERS\n - Orchestration     | Kubernetes (K8s)       | EKS                     | GKE                      | AKS\n - Serverless (CaaS) | Knative                | Fargate                 | Cloud Run                | Container Apps\n\nBIG DATA (Compute)\n - 1-Core, 1-CPU     | Pandas (In-Memory)     | EC2 + Pandas            | GCE + Pandas             | VM + Pandas\n - Multi-Core, 1-CPU | Polars / DuckDB        | EC2 + Polars/DuckDB     | GCE + Polars/DuckDB      | VM + Polars/DuckDB\n - Dist. Multi-CPU   | Apache Spark / Trino   | EMR / Glue              | Dataproc                 | HDInsight / Databricks\n\nAI / ML\n - Platform / Ops    | Kubeflow, MLflow       | SageMaker               | Vertex AI                | Azure Machine Learning\n - GenAI / LLMs      | vLLM, HuggingFace      | Bedrock                 | Vertex AI (Gemini)       | Azure OpenAI\n\nSECURITY\n - Identity          | Keycloak (OIDC)        | IAM / Cognito           | Cloud IAM                | Entra ID (Azure AD)\n - Secrets/Crypto    | HashiCorp Vault        | Secrets Manager / KMS   | Secret Manager / KMS     | Key Vault\n\nNETWORKING\n - API / Routing     | Envoy, Kong            | API Gateway             | API Gateway / Apigee     | API Management\n - Service Mesh      | Istio, Linkerd         | App Mesh                | Anthos Service Mesh      | Azure Service Mesh\n\nOBSERVABILITY\n - Logs/Metrics/Trace| Prom / Loki / Jaeger   | CloudWatch / X-Ray      | Cloud Ops (Stackdriver)  | Azure Monitor",
      "fontSize": 37.09784482758621,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16,
      "frameId": "Ns8tkcfQ1gouZGlgHC0ly",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CATEGORY             | OPEN SOURCE / AGNOSTIC | AWS                     | GCP                      | AZURE\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCOMPUTE\n - Server (VM)       | KVM, KubeVirt          | EC2                     | Compute Engine (GCE)     | Virtual Machines\n - Serverless        | OpenFaaS, Knative      | Lambda                  | Cloud Functions          | Azure Functions\n\nSTORAGE\n - Blob / Lakehouse  | MinIO + Apache Iceberg | S3 + Athena/Lake Form.  | GCS + BigLake            | ADLS + Fabric/Synapse\n - Relational        | PostgreSQL / MySQL     | RDS / Aurora            | Cloud SQL / AlloyDB      | Azure SQL\n - KV / Document     | Redis / MongoDB        | DynamoDB                | Firestore                | Cosmos DB\n - Wide-Column       | Apache Cassandra       | Keyspaces               | Bigtable                 | Cosmos DB (Cassandra API)\n\nCONTAINERS\n - Orchestration     | Kubernetes (K8s)       | EKS                     | GKE                      | AKS\n - Serverless (CaaS) | Knative                | Fargate                 | Cloud Run                | Container Apps\n\nBIG DATA (Compute)\n - 1-Core, 1-CPU     | Pandas (In-Memory)     | EC2 + Pandas            | GCE + Pandas             | VM + Pandas\n - Multi-Core, 1-CPU | Polars / DuckDB        | EC2 + Polars/DuckDB     | GCE + Polars/DuckDB      | VM + Polars/DuckDB\n - Dist. Multi-CPU   | Apache Spark / Trino   | EMR / Glue              | Dataproc                 | HDInsight / Databricks\n\nAI / ML\n - Platform / Ops    | Kubeflow, MLflow       | SageMaker               | Vertex AI                | Azure Machine Learning\n - GenAI / LLMs      | vLLM, HuggingFace      | Bedrock                 | Vertex AI (Gemini)       | Azure OpenAI\n\nSECURITY\n - Identity          | Keycloak (OIDC)        | IAM / Cognito           | Cloud IAM                | Entra ID (Azure AD)\n - Secrets/Crypto    | HashiCorp Vault        | Secrets Manager / KMS   | Secret Manager / KMS     | Key Vault\n\nNETWORKING\n - API / Routing     | Envoy, Kong            | API Gateway             | API Gateway / Apigee     | API Management\n - Service Mesh      | Istio, Linkerd         | App Mesh                | Anthos Service Mesh      | Azure Service Mesh\n\nOBSERVABILITY\n - Logs/Metrics/Trace| Prom / Loki / Jaeger   | CloudWatch / X-Ray      | Cloud Ops (Stackdriver)  | Azure Monitor",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.0317460317460319
    },
    {
