      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kubernetes allows you to create a cluster of nodes, each labeled with resources it may have, and to orchestrate running containers on the nodes. ",
